This file conntain the network.

n is in the Domain N* = {1,2,...}
m is in the Domain N  = {0,1,2,...}
Remark: Connexion are setup by a name You have initiate before.


the file need to be file as follow:
NB_ANTENNA (1..n)
NAME_ANTENNA_1 POSITION_ANTENNA_x_1 POSITION_ANTENNA_y_1 
NAME_ANTENNA_2 POSITION_ANTENNA_x_2 POSITION_ANTENNA_y_2 
...
NAME_ANTENNA_n POSITION_ANTENNA_x_n POSITION_ANTENNA_y_n 
NB_CONNEXION_BETWEEN_ANTENNA (0..m)
NAME_ANTENNA_SRC_1 NAME_ANTENNA_DEST_1
NAME_ANTENNA_SRC_2 NAME_ANTENNA_DEST_2
...
NAME_ANTENNA_DEST_m NAME_ANTENNA_DEST_m
[EOF]

see exemple_1.net: to understand